# Sweep/ablation arm overrides. resolve_config reads this ahead of the
# dataclass defaults, so a committed copy would silently move every
# config_hash in the repo -- the failure that put arm 2's -0.01 on main
# in 77cb5ee. Arms are a local, temporary state.
config.toml
